Rāma asks how Sugrīva knows entire earth circle --- Vālin chases buffalo Dundubhi into Malaya cave --- Sugrīva guards mouth year sees bloodflood deems brother slain --- Sugrīva blocks cave mouth seizes Kiṣkindhā Tārā Rumā --- Vālin returns slaying demon reclaiming kingdom wrathfully --- Vālin chases fleeing Sugrīva across rivers cities lands --- Hanumān recalls Mataṅga curse barring Vālin from R̥śyamūka --- Sugrīva shelters at R̥śyamūka having seen whole earth
